<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 28/29.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 28/29.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>28/29. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	  April 29/30    April 28/29</p>
<p> CZK	0.44655	0.44633</p>
<p> DKK	2.10083	2.10129</p>
<p> FIM	2.65795	2.6629</p>
<p> HUF	0.07588	0.07604</p>
<p> JPY	0.10926	0.10942</p>
<p> LTL	3.46225	3.4645</p>
<p> LVL     23.72865     23.72336</p>
<p> RUR	0.00241	0.00241</p>
<p> SEK	1.7644	 1.7766</p>
<p> UAH	7.62334	7.52539</p>
<p> USD     13.8516	13.585</p>
<p> XEU     15.6253	15.61034</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
